/26/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/18">Power to specify regulatory functions</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/19">Guidance by the Secretary of State</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/part/2/crossheading/report-on-investigations-under-financial-regulators-complaints-scheme">Report on investigations under financial regulators' complaints scheme</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/20">Independent Complaints Commissioner: reporting duty</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/part/2/crossheading/business-impact-target">Business impact target</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/21">21.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/21">Duty on Secretary of State to publish business impact target etc</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/22">22.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/22">Sections 21 and 23 to 25: “qualifying regulatory provisions” etc</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/23">23.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"