/28">Duty to review regulatory provisions in secondary legislation</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/29">29.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/29">Section 28(1)(b): interpretation</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/30">30.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/30">Section 28(2)(a): “provision for review”</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/31">31.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/31">Section 28(2)(b): appropriateness of making provision for review</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/32">32.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/32">Sections 28 to 31 etc: supplementary</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/part/2/crossheading/definitions-of-small-and-micro-business">Definitions of small and micro business</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/33">33.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/33">Definitions of small and micro business</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/section/34">34.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2015/26/s